{"id":"n83177-1-10","stage":2,"title":"어려움 · 困难","scene":"人物与表达","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n83177-1-10-1","ko":"회사 생활에 어려움은 없어요?","zh":"工作中有遇到什么困难吗？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"회사","meaning":"公司，企业，会社","explanation":"회사：公司，企业，会社。","readings":[{"term":"회사","audio":"/audio/a109dcd7f6f11c2e1703.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"31668","senseId":"1","lemma":"회사","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"회사","audio":"/audio/a109dcd7f6f11c2e1703.mp3"}},{"text":"생활에","meaning":"生活","explanation":"생활：生活；에：格助词，表示时间、位置、去向、对象等；需结合整句理解。","readings":[{"term":"생활","audio":"/audio/6a739e74f8dfb7fbc5ec.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"74183","senseId":"3","lemma":"생활","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"생활에","audio":"/audio/da37def5e29ff88b4e06.mp3"}},{"text":"어려움은","meaning":"困难","explanation":"어려움：困难；은：话题或对比助词。","readings":[{"term":"어려움","audio":"/audio/fac94f696643f1bedee6.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"83177","senseId":"1","lemma":"어려움","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"어려움은","audio":"/audio/f0819a31b4557f15f5a7.mp3"}},{"text":"없어요?","meaning":"没有","explanation":"없다：没有；어요：礼貌句末；可随语调表示陈述或询问。","readings":[{"term":"없다","audio":"/audio/815560dcd5b828930ac0.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"89917","senseId":"8","lemma":"없다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"없어요","audio":"/audio/a3a387384b956d187d4f.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"a109dcd7f6f11c2e","term":"회사","zh":"公司，企业，会社","audio":"/audio/a109dcd7f6f11c2e1703.mp3","entryId":"31668","definition":"想要通过事业获得利益的许多人一起建立的法人团体。","pronunciation":["회ː사","훼ː사"]},{"id":"6a739e74f8dfb7fb","term":"생활","zh":"生活","audio":"/audio/6a739e74f8dfb7fbc5ec.mp3","entryId":"74183","definition":"作为某组织的一员进行活动。","pronunciation":["생활"]},{"id":"fac94f696643f1be","term":"어려움","zh":"困难","audio":"/audio/fac94f696643f1bedee6.mp3","entryId":"83177","definition":"费力或痛苦的东西。","pronunciation":["어려움"]},{"id":"815560dcd5b82893","term":"없다","zh":"没有","audio":"/audio/815560dcd5b828930ac0.mp3","entryId":"89917","definition":"人或动物不停留或生活在某处。","pronunciation":["업ː따"]}],"audio":"/audio/7ca831cf1586d998ddf4.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n83177-1-10-2","ko":"일을 처음 해 봐서 그런지 조금 어렵고 힘드네요.","zh":"因为这是我第一次做这份工作，所以觉得有点困难，也很吃力。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"일을","meaning":"事情，工作","explanation":"일：事情，工作；을：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"일","audio":"/audio/dfc76879e2f5c3ead091.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"91895","senseId":"1","lemma":"일","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"일을","audio":"/audio/9a5fd6c2b18669a93295.mp3"}},{"text":"처음","meaning":"第一次，初次","explanation":"처음：第一次，初次。","readings":[{"term":"처음","audio":"/audio/91390eadfad43d09c458.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"17170","senseId":"1","lemma":"처음","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"처음","audio":"/audio/91390eadfad43d09c458.mp3"}},{"text":"해","meaning":"做，干","explanation":"하다：做，干；어：连接后续动作或辅助表达；常与前面的词干缩合。","readings":[{"term":"하다","audio":"/audio/505de0a2f6be73fa7758.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"73277","senseId":"1","lemma":"하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"해","audio":"/audio/b4ec4274b7799f1f17e5.mp3"}},{"text":"봐서","meaning":"做过、经历过（-아/어 보다）","explanation":"보다：做过、经历过（-아/어 보다）；어서：连接原因与结果，或前后相接的动作。","readings":[{"term":"보다","audio":"/audio/6a45cf834264a5ec3611.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62171","senseId":"2","lemma":"보다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"봐서","audio":"/audio/166d265d4dfd37db3f1c.mp3"}},{"text":"그런지","meaning":"那样","explanation":"그렇다：那样；ㄴ지：引入未确定的信息、间接疑问或选择：“是否、怎么、何时”等。","readings":[{"term":"그렇다","audio":"/audio/f7c6efa694aaef9559bd.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"61178","senseId":"1","lemma":"그렇다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"그런지","audio":"/audio/704d00595d8d6a229772.mp3"}},{"text":"조금","meaning":"一点点，稍微，略微","explanation":"조금：一点点，稍微，略微。","readings":[{"term":"조금","audio":"/audio/b4049b7414b62d9bee5d.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"61176","senseId":"1","lemma":"조금","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"조금","audio":"/audio/b4049b7414b62d9bee5d.mp3"}},{"text":"어렵고","meaning":"难，不容易","explanation":"어렵다：难，不容易；고：连接并列或先后的动作、状态；也用于 -고 있다 等搭配。","readings":[{"term":"어렵다","audio":"/audio/55d0f08434308816bcaf.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62232","senseId":"1","lemma":"어렵다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"어렵고","audio":"/audio/495d4198208b79f571bb.mp3"}},{"text":"힘드네요.","meaning":"累，费力，费劲，辛苦，用力","explanation":"힘들다：累，费力，费劲，辛苦，用力；네요：对新发现的情况表示感叹或确认，礼貌句末。","readings":[{"term":"힘들다","audio":"/audio/8eec39c3609a6c71740f.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"91737","senseId":"1","lemma":"힘들다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"힘드네요","audio":"/audio/c4790c8f604e185eae86.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"dfc76879e2f5c3ea","term":"일","zh":"事情，工作","audio":"/audio/dfc76879e2f5c3ead091.mp3","entryId":"91895","definition":"为了实现某事而使用身体或精神的活动；或指该活动的对象。","pronunciation":["일ː"]},{"id":"91390eadfad43d09","term":"처음","zh":"第一次，初次","audio":"/audio/91390eadfad43d09c458.mp3","entryId":"17170","definition":"在顺序或时间上排在最前面。","pronunciation":["처음"]},{"id":"505de0a2f6be73fa","term":"하다","zh":"做，干","audio":"/audio/505de0a2f6be73fa7758.mp3","entryId":"73277","definition":"进行某种行动、动作或活动。","pronunciation":["하다"]},{"id":"6a45cf834264a5ec","term":"보다","zh":"做过、经历过（-아/어 보다）","audio":"/audio/6a45cf834264a5ec3611.mp3","entryId":"62171","definition":"做过、经历过（-아/어 보다）","pronunciation":["보다"]},{"id":"f7c6efa694aaef95","term":"그렇다","zh":"那样","audio":"/audio/f7c6efa694aaef9559bd.mp3","entryId":"61178","definition":"表示状态、样子、性质等与此相同。","pronunciation":["그러타"]},{"id":"b4049b7414b62d9b","term":"조금","zh":"一点点，稍微，略微","audio":"/audio/b4049b7414b62d9bee5d.mp3","entryId":"61176","definition":"微量或微小的程度。","pronunciation":["조금"]},{"id":"55d0f08434308816","term":"어렵